{"title":"The Widmoria Muster","subtitle":"January 25, 2026","main_story":{"headline":"Dungeon Muster at Widmoria as the Region Reckons With Its Pyramid","lede":"An evening expedition assembled itself in open chat while a newcomer's question about high-tier work got the same answer from every direction: the base of the pyramid is always Tier 1.","body":"The evening's main event assembled itself over an hour of open chat. **Aryn** put out the call, "im ready for dungeon crawls when everyone else is," and directions followed for anyone who needed them. **Archaelic** confessed, "Would love to join, just dont have any plate." and was told a bow and a place in the back would do.

Behind the outing sits a real ambition — and a logistical test. **TinyHouseGamer** noted that "damn R8 is doing T7 dungeons atm", and **Ariakan** laid the region's position out plainly: "im all for running t7s here domesctically, just hard to gather people with our pop".

The day's other seminar was economics. **Peanuts** supplied the theory: "its a pyramid , every time the pyramid gets bigger, but the base of the pyramid is always Tier1". **HereticalSage** did the arithmetic, "so in the end game you need thousands of t1s"."}}
